BlackBox :vector module
=======================

This module embeds the ART method-hooking engine used by Vector (LSPosed fork) and is therefore
distributed under the GNU General Public License v3 (see COPYING). Any build that includes this
module must be distributed under GPL-3.0-compatible terms, including its corresponding source.

Third-party components (sources are vendored under src/main/cpp/external and src/main/java):

  Vector (https://github.com/JingMatrix/Vector)      GPL-3.0   ELF symbol resolver (vector_native),
                                                                legacy Xposed API sources (de.robv.*)
  LSPlant (https://github.com/JingMatrix/LSPlant)    LGPL-3.0  ART hooking library (external/lsplant)
  Dobby (https://github.com/jmpews/Dobby)            Apache-2.0 inline hook library (external/dobby)
  fmt (https://github.com/fmtlib/fmt)                MIT       formatting (external/fmt)
  xz-embedded (https://tukaani.org/xz/embedded.html) Public domain / 0BSD (external/xz-embedded)
  Apache Commons Lang (ClassUtilsX, MemberUtils)     Apache-2.0 org.apache.commons.lang3.*
  XposedBridge API (rovo89)                          Apache-2.0 de.robv.android.xposed.* API shapes

Each vendored directory keeps its own licence file where upstream provides one.
